COMMENT ON FUNCTION "public"."audit_capture"() IS 'Generic audit trigger. Resolves actor via auth.uid(), reads intent/correlation from app.* GUCs, diffs OLD vs NEW, classifies the event by which columns changed, and inserts one row into audit_events. Owned by postgres so SECURITY DEFINER bypasses RLS.';



